    "category": "template",
    "description": "Full Site Editing (FSE) block template for single posts & case studies",
    "content": "<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"tagName\":\"header\",\"area\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"className\":\"site-main py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group site-main py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8\">\n\n  <!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"space-y-4 text-center\"} -->\n  <div class=\"wp-block-group space-y-4 text-center\">\n    <!-- wp:post-date {\"className\":\"text-xs text-orange-600 font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\"} /-->\n    <!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 leading-tight\"} /-->\n    <!-- wp:post-author {\"showAvatar\":true,\"avatarSize\":36,\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-neutral-600\"} /-->\n  </div>\n  <!-- /wp:group -->\n\n  <!-- wp:post-featured-image {\"aspectRatio\":\"16/9\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}},\"className\":\"shadow-md\"} /-->\n\n  <!-- wp:post-content {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"},\"className\":\"prose prose-neutral max-w-none text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6\"} /-->\n\n  <!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 flex justify-between items-center\"} -->\n  <div class=\"wp-block-group pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 flex justify-between items-center\">\n    <!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"previous\",\"label\":\"← Previous Project\"} /-->\n    <!-- wp:post-navigation-link {\"type\":\"next\",\"label\":\"Next Project →\"} /-->\n  </div>\n  <!-- /wp:group -->\n\n</main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"tagName\":\"footer\",\"area\":\"footer\"} /-->\n"
